{"id":"v03-cause","title":"Cause in a complex sentence","blocks":[{"t":"h","text":"потому что"},{"t":"list","items":["because"]},{"t":"note","text":"From Wiktionary, «потому что» (en.wiktionary.org, CC BY-SA 4.0)."},{"t":"h","text":"так как"},{"t":"list","items":["as, since, because, inasmuch as"]},{"t":"note","text":"From Wiktionary, «так как» (en.wiktionary.org, CC BY-SA 4.0)."},{"t":"h","text":"поскольку"},{"t":"list","items":["inasmuch as, as","since"]},{"t":"ex","items":[["'''Поско́льку''' Олимпи́йские и́гры собира́ют ты́сячи боле́льщиков и спортсме́нов, в Со́чи бы́ли постро́ены деся́тки но́вых гости́ниц.","'''Since''' the Olympic Games attract thousands of fans and athletes, dozens of new hotels were built in Sochi.|inline=no"]]},{"t":"note","text":"From Wiktionary, «поскольку» (en.wiktionary.org, CC BY-SA 4.0)."},{"t":"h","text":"поэтому"},{"t":"list","items":["so, therefore, that's why"]},{"t":"note","text":"From Wiktionary, «поэтому» (en.wiktionary.org, CC BY-SA 4.0)."},{"t":"h","text":"так что"},{"t":"list","items":["so","so that"]},{"t":"note","text":"From Wiktionary, «так что» (en.wiktionary.org, CC BY-SA 4.0)."}],"exercises":[]}